--- !u!114 &114160561379488162
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1150613641295884}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 635
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 结丹时所需要消耗的灵气数量极为恐怖，只靠平日储备的灵气自然没有十足把握。因此大部分人都会选择在突破前服用丹药，增加自己结丹的成功率。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114778225593107476}
  AvatarIntID: 417
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114849887636107367
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1150613641295884}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 823
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 后山麟庙乃是宗门老祖炎麟大圣闭关之地，平日里有绝焰堂弟子驻守，{shidi}如无必要还是不要乱转。
  description:
